+### GEMM shape grid and batched GEMM
+
+`bench/stage1.py`:
+
+| shape | fp32 | fp16 | bf16 |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 2048^3 | 8.39 TF | 6.64 TF | 4.26 TF |
+| 4096^3 | 8.16 TF | 6.92 TF | 4.40 TF |
+| batched b=8, 1024^3 | 7.52 TF | 7.05 TF | - |
+| strided-batched b=8, 1024^3 | 7.51 TF | 6.90 TF | - |
