+| n | native bf16 | fp32 emulation | relative error |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 2048 | 3.75 ms / 4.58 TF | 2.52 ms / 6.83 TF | 0.0139 (both) |
+| 4096 | 31.23 ms / 4.40 TF | 17.35 ms / 7.92 TF | 0.0196 (both) |
