+| bool 2D | 2.4e-4 | 9.8e-4 |
+| additive 2D | 4.9e-4 | 9.8e-4 |
+| bool 4D per head | 2.4e-4 | 9.8e-4 |
+| additive 3D per batch | 4.9e-4 | 9.8e-4 |
+| bool 2D + causal | 9.8e-4 | 2.0e-3 |
+| additive 2D + causal | 9.8e-4 | 3.9e-3 |
